t-size:28px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#0f1716;\">Se sumó una persona a la waitlist</h1>\n<p style=\"margin:0 0 16px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.55;color:#495251;\">Entró un registro nuevo. Estos son sus datos.</p>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 24px;border-top:1px solid #dfe4e4;\">\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Nombre</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.firstName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }} {{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.lastName) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Auto de interés</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.model) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'No indicó' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Teléfono</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.phone) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Email</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.email) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') }}</td>\n  </tr>\n  <tr>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 16px 12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#495251;vertical-align:top;width:34%;\">Vino desde</td>\n    <td style=\"padding:12px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #dfe4e4;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:600;color:#0f1716;vertical-align:top;\">{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.source) ?? '').trim().replace(/[&<>\"']/g, c => '&#' + c.charCodeAt(0) + ';') || 'web' }}</td>\n  </tr>\n</table>\n\n<table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0;\"><tr>\n  <td style=\"border-radius:8px;background:#1d605b;\">\n    <a href=\"https://wa.me/{{ String(($('Webhook waitlist').item.json.body.phone) ?? '').replace(/[^0-9]/g, '') }}\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:14px 24px;font-family:'Switzer','Helvetica Neue',Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;font-s